; CodeQL query: Likely Bugs/Statements/EmptyLockStatement.ql
; CodeQL commit: ae741615f3e178ce61289a651790dc67fcc18e19
; Engine contract: report lock statements whose body is a block with no
; statements. Like CodeQL's getNumberOfStmts() = 0, comments and preprocessor
; directive lines inside the block do not count, so a comment-only body is
; reported. An empty statement `;`, a nested block, and a body that is not a
; block, as in `lock (x) ;`, are near misses. The body form is read from
; source because block body state does not separate these shapes.
(policy :schema-version 1
  :id "bifrost.csharp-codeql-quality.empty-lock-statement"
  :name "C# empty lock statement"
  :message "empty lock statement"
  :severity warning
  :description "Mirrors CodeQL csharp/ql/src/Likely Bugs/Statements/EmptyLockStatement.ql at commit ae741615f3e178ce61289a651790dc67fcc18e19. Reports lock statements whose block holds no statements, counting a comment-only block as empty."
  :tags ["csharp" "codeql" "quality" "concurrency"]
  :analysis (analysis :type match :selector
    (rql :schema-version 1
      (language csharp
        (lock :body (block (text/regex "\\A\\{(?:\\s|//[^\\n]*|/\\*[\\s\\S]*?\\*/|#[^\\n]*)*\\}\\z")))))))
